00:47:38,823 --> 00:47:44,823
Charming is a 2018 animated musical comedy film
written and directed by Ross Venokur.

10
00:52:56,470 --> 00:53:02,470
Produced by Vanguard Animation, 3QU Media, Cinesite and WV Enterprises, the film features
the voices of Demi Lovato, Wilmer Valderrama, Sia, Ashley Tisdale, G.E.M.

11
00:58:14,117 --> 00:58:20,117
and Avril Lavigne.

12
