Out Boy frontman Patrick Stump, and Steve Aoki contributing songs.

13
01:08:49,411 --> 01:08:55,411
The film had its world premiere in Spain on 20 April 2018,
and was met with generally negative reviews.

14
01:14:07,058 --> 01:14:13,058
